{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54583","headline":"兵要望江南 占霞第六（京本列第二十六○十一首） 三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占霞第六（京本列第二十六○十一首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵发日，霞气日辰幷（辛本、川本作「兵」）。\n纵有前程应（京本作「勿」）大战，逢霞生日应须赢，拗日不宜（京本作「须」）征（辛本、川本作「多精」。\n甲乙日黄、戊己日黑之类）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}